--- expect
('ab' = `value`)
===

### name: op.in.one-value.literal-on-the-left.eql-twin
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"A": {"kind": "column", "column": "value", "type": "TEXT", "exact": true}}
--- source
"ab" EQL A
--- expect
('ab' = `value`)
===

### name: op.in.one-value.number-beside-an-exact-column
--- note
A number is cast beside an exact column, as EQL casts it: compared as numbers, '3.0' = 3 would match where SEL says FALSE.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"A": {"kind": "column", "column": "value", "type": "TEXT", "exact": true}}
--- source
A IN 3
--- expect
(`value` = CAST(3 AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)
===

### name: op.in.one-value.number-beside-an-exact-column.eql-twin
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"A": {"kind": "column", "column": "value", "type": "TEXT", "exact": true}}
--- source
A EQL 3
--- expect
(`value` = CAST(3 AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)
===

### name: op.in.one-value.params
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"A": {"kind": "column", "column": "value", "type": "TEXT", "exact": true}}
--- mode
params
--- source
A IN ("ab")
--- expect
(`value` = ?)
--- params
t"ab"
===

### name: op.in.one-value.none-is-refused-at-the-operand
--- note
Refused as `T EQL NULL` is, at the NULL.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"T": {"kind": "column", "column": "name", "type": "TEXT"}}
--- source
T IN NULL
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:6
===

### name: op.in.one-value.boolean-is-refused-at-the-operand
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"F": {"kind": "column", "column": "f", "type": "BOOL"}}
--- source
F IN "x"
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:3
===

### name: op.in.one-value.left-operand-is-translated-first
--- note
EQL translates left to right, so the first refusal is the left operand's. The scalar branch rendered the right operand first and blamed H.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{}
--- source
G IN H
--- error
E_SQL_UNBOUND 1:1
===
### name: op.in.list.boolean-needle-is-refused-at-the-element
--- note
The list branch's own kind guard: a BOOL needle against number elements is refused at the
first element, as `F EQL 1` is at its operand (sql/mutations.json
bool-compared-to-a-number-in-a-list).
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"F": {"kind": "column", "column": "f", "type": "BOOL"}}
--- source
F IN (1, 2)
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:7
===
